Scope note

This licence covers the tooling, documentation, build scripts, and the
reconstructed source text authored by this project's contributors.

Fable: The Lost Chapters, its executable, assets, symbols, and trademarks are
the property of their respective owners. This repository does not contain the
retail executable, any game asset, any debug database, or any decoded content;
see README section "Project boundaries". You need your own legitimately owned
copy of the game to build or verify anything here.

The reconstructed sources under rebuild/src are written by hand and by
automated tooling to compile, under the original era compiler, to instruction
bytes identical to the retail binary. They are provided for interoperability,
preservation, and modding research. No claim is made to the original
copyrighted work they describe.
